What are you thinking?

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:52.090
You're passing a girl,
who didn't even audition.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:56.920
Someday, the audience will come here
just to see her.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.500
Is it true?

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:04.700
Yeah, that's what Kalos said.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.140
Is it really okay?

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:08.380
Sure, it is. Have confidence in yourself.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:11.550
Besides, I'm happy that I don't have
to say goodbye to you...

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:12.480
Sora!

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:12.480
Besides, I'm happy that I don't have
to say goodbye to you...

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:12.840
Sora!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:14.610
Mr. Policeman!

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.350
How did it go?

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:20.050
I passed! I was able to pass!

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:21.960
Is that so? I'm happy for you!

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.860
I had faith in you, you know.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.260
Thank you!

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:29.390
Starting today, I'm your first fan, Sora!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.230
This is the dormitory.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.500
Just get some rest for today.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.240
Thank you.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.310
Kaleido Stage...

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.380
I'm really a part of it now!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.250
This doll...

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:00.990
I'm pretty sure it's the same as the one
in the dressing room...

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:03.950
So, you can see me.

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:06.370
It tal- It really talked...

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.830
Why do you laugh?

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.210
My name is Fool.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:21.140
I am the Spirit of the Stage.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.620
Spirit of the Stage?

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.330
<i>When you're lonely, what do you do?</i>

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.330
<i>When you sabishii toki doushitemasuka</i>

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.760
<i>Never say you don't get any of that</i>

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.760
<i>Never say sonna no wakannai</i>

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.630
<i>Sleep, play, flip through a magazine</i>

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.630
<i>Nemuru asobu magazine mekuru</i>

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.970
<i>When you're lonely, you're lonely</i>

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.970
<i>Sabishii toki wa sabishii yo</i>

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:46.740
<i>Like always, invisible vibes fly around
the city today, tulututu</i>

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:46.740
<i>Mienai denpa ga kyou mo
tulututu machi ni tobikau</i>

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:51.410
<i>Anyway, the vector of my heart is
talking about so many reasons</i>

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:51.410
<i>Anyway kokoro no bekutoru
so many reason hanashiteru</i>

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:56.120
<i>I want to be free and fly the skies</i>

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:56.120
<i>Jiyuu ni sora o tobitai keredo</i>

00:21:56.120 --> 00:22:00.790
<i>But I don't have space to spread my wings</i>

00:21:56.120 --> 00:22:00.790
<i>Hane o hirogeru basho ga nai</i>

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:02.960
<i>But I have faith</i>

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:02.960
<i>Demo shinjiteru</i>

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:07.660
<i>There is a future yet to be shaped</i>

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:07.660
<i>Katachi no nai mirai ga aru yo</i>

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:12.330
<i>And there's a me that I want to shape</i>

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:12.330
<i>Katachi ni shitai watashi ga iru</i>

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:18.810
<i>Even if I'm sad, even if it's a mistake</i>

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:18.810
<i>Kanashikutemo machigai demo</i>

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:24.140
<i>I'll do what I want and
fly towards the freedom</i>

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:24.140
<i>Omou mama fly to the free</i>

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:31.480
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:34.290
Let us see your Golden Phoenix.

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:34.990
And so,

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:38.330
I'm going to be trying Miss Layla's
big routine, the Golden Phoenix!

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:42.230
And Miss Layla's said she'll have my
resignation if I can't do it!

00:22:42.230 --> 00:22:44.270
It's a difficult routine that expresses
Juliet's passion

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:45.600
as she flies into Romeo's arms.

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:48.300
Everyone says Miss Layla is the only
person who can pull it off!

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:51.070
Darn it! I've come this far! I just gotta do it!
Gotta! Gotta! Gotta!

